    "detailed_description": "<strong>Cyberpunk Girls</strong> is a brutal action shooter set in the year 2169 in the cyber metropolis Oplot. The city of the future, which has become a save heaven for thugs, hackers, and gold diggers. Win the most breathtaking battles. And remember that everything comes with a price.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1867280/extras/a03d86d5653e4ccf82f9c6de9e18a566.poster.avif?t=1728938605\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1867280/extras/a03d86d5653e4ccf82f9c6de9e18a566.webm?t=1728938605\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1867280/extras/a03d86d5653e4ccf82f9c6de9e18a566.mp4?t=1728938605\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><strong>Meet Elsa.</strong> She topped charts for the longest time, until the recent circumstances revealed a shocking truth to her, which changed the rules of the game\u2026 Use this opportunity to challenge those who would like nothing else but to see you fail. <br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1867280/extras/2e614e9e09bf7fd7ff72a7d3fa64d2e3.poster.avif?t=1728938605\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1867280/extras/2e614e9e09bf7fd7ff72a7d3fa64d2e3.webm?t=1728938605\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1867280/extras/2e614e9e09bf7fd7ff72a7d3fa64d2e3.mp4?t=1728938605\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Game Features:</h2><br><strong>Brutal Combat:</strong> game features a combat that balances brute force and patience waiting for the right moment. Equip yourself with some deadly high-tech weapons and kill them all!<br><br><strong>Story-Driven Action:</strong> dive deep into our girls' personalities &amp; go through the story together with them. <br><br><strong>Cyberpunk Inspired Aestetics:</strong> dive in the most hight-tech and upscale fufture you could ever imagine. Fight all your enemies and immerse in the story to fully embrace the world of Oplot city!<br><br><strong>Exceptional Soundtrack:</strong> it's dynamic. It's fun. What else could you wish for?<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1867280/extras/6cb18587c3069285410d28d96d0cd0b1.poster.avif?t=1728938605\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1867280/extras/6cb18587c3069285410d28d96d0cd0b1.webm?t=1728938605\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1867280/extras/6cb18587c3069285410d28d96d0cd0b1.mp4?t=1728938605\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div>",
